{"id": "63123", "title": "夏露", "author": "空梦", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 29, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63123.htm", "intro": "题记：\r\n\r\n赤裸肌肤，露骨欢愉，那时夏天\r\n夏露\r\n夏时季笑了，李昱泊皱了眉。\r\n小镇便利店的马路边，有摩车党呼啸而过，其中有个认识李昱泊的在高喊著：泊哥……\r\n听到不识相的声音李昱泊暴躁地甩了手中的啤酒瓶过去，碎了一地的玻璃。\r\n然後，李昱泊回头，咬著牙低沈地说：你真要走？", "base": "files/article/html/63/63123", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "9350331.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9350333.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-16", "file": "9350335.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17-23", "file": "9350336.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24-30", "file": "9350339.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "9350340.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-41", "file": "9350342.html", "available": false}, {"title": "42-47", "file": "9350343.html", "available": false}, {"title": "48-53", "file": "9350344.html", "available": false}, {"title": "54-59", "file": "9350346.html", "available": false}, {"title": "60-63", "file": "9350347.html", "available": false}, {"title": "64-69", "file": "9350349.html", "available": false}, {"title": "70-75", "file": "9350351.html", "available": false}, {"title": "76-80", "file": "9350353.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-85", "file": "9350354.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-89", "file": "9350355.html", "available": false}, {"title": "90-93", "file": "9350357.html", "available": false}, {"title": "94-98", "file": "9350360.html", "available": false}, {"title": "99-101", "file": "9350362.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "9350364.html", "available": false}, {"title": "102-107", "file": "9350370.html", "available": false}, {"title": "108-112", "file": "9350372.html", "available": false}, {"title": "113-118", "file": "9350375.html", "available": false}, {"title": "119-122", "file": "9350377.html", "available": false}, {"title": "123-126", "file": "9350379.html", "available": false}, {"titl